{"title":"Rimeclaw Crusher","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 54 Rimeclaw that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher?lv=54\">Lv 54</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>4</td><td>in the wilds around -103, -1023</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeclaw-crusher?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around -107, -1021</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rime-barnacle\" title=\"Rime Barnacle - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2aa6085abb38dae1d13f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rime Barnacle</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2519.5px,1547.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/8/-7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-1792px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/8/-6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-1536px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/9/-7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:-1792px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/9/-6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:-1536px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/10/-7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2560px;top:-1792px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/10/-6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2560px;top:-1536px\"><i style=\"left:2611.3px;top:-1611.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2444.8px;top:-1479.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2439.4px;top:-1482.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2582.5px;top:-1615.1px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -105, -1021 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rimeclaw-crusher\">Show on map</butt